<title>HONG KONG: Thai Farmers Bank sets US$125 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Thai Farmers Bank sets US$125 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Bank Singapore.</p>
<p> BORROWER   THAI FARMERS BANK ACTING THROUGH ITS HONGKONG BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$125 MLN  COUPON	6ML+20   MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	  ISS PRICE   PAR	LAUNCH    14.JAN.97</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS	 NONE     REPLIES   24.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	  REPAYMENT   BULLET   DENOMS    --</p>
<p> RATING     NONE	  SALE LMTS   US,UK,SING, THAI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	   CRS DEF     YES	FORCE MAJ IPMA 2</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  THAILAND    GOV LAW     --	 PAY DATE  05.FEB.97</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS    US$6-10 MLN  35BP  ALL-IN  27</p>
<p>   MANAGERS		US$3-5 MLN   35BP  ALL-IN  27</p>
<p> SOLE LEAD MANAGER   ABN AMRO BANK SINGAPORE</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUER RATING A2 BY MOODY'S AND A- BY S&amp;P.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
